      "side": 1,
      "message": "The http2 flag is ignored on this branch, so connect(..., quicConfig, false) silently returns an HTTP/3 client to a caller who asked for HTTP/1.1. Could we either reject that combination with an UnsupportedConfigurationException here, or update the @param http2 javadoc above to say the flag does not apply to the QUIC transport?",
