      "writtenOn": "2026-08-24T11:12:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This disables hostname verification for every HTTP/3 connection while Netty\u0027s client builder has it on by default. Is this the desirable behaviour? If so can you add a comment explaining why the identification has to be off here?",
