      "writtenOn": "2026-08-24T11:12:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If the caller of connect() cancels the returned future while the handshake is still running, this set() is discarded (it just returns false which we ignore here). Nothing ever holds the QuicUnderlay, and the UDP socket plus QUIC connection stay open for the life of the process - leaked. It might be a good idea to check the returned boolean here and close both channels if it\u0027s false.",
      "revId": "44ee90a510f3386139d634871be5224f21275475",
      "serverId": "7fc14799-209e-464c-9743-7a06c2c21a81"
    },
